ict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's step sister. She is neat, beautiful, and kind."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has always loved the protagonist as a man, and has always held smoldering feelings for him in her heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a result of her distorted love for him, she has decided to take this incident as an opportunity to take her brother in her arms and give him all the love he has been holding in his heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39895"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の義姉。主人公の通う学園の女教師。また主人公の担任でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚な美しさを持った心優しき女性で、学園でも人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は主人公を一人の男性として愛しており、そうした燻った気持ちをずっと持ち続けてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、主人公の行動によって、抑えてきた欲望が爆発してしまい……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16762","sourceWorkId":"11300","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の義姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚で綺麗な優しい姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔から主人公のことを男として愛しており、ずっと心の中にくすぶった気持ちを持ち続けてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歪んだ愛情の結果として、今回の件を契機に弟を手篭めにし、持て余してきた愛欲をぶつけることに。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"163966"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16762","sourceWorkId":"11300","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16762","sourceWorkId":"11300","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16762","sourceWorkId":"11300","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16762","sourceWorkId":"11300","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/53d0e